[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954217887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107267#issuecomment-2954217887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107267","id":2954217887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wFcmf","user":{"login":"inhalt120g","id":106015575,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGrVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106015575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g","html_url":"https://github.com/inhalt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T18:36:02Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T18:36:02Z","body":"This has been happening on older builds too, at least since 4.2 (despite me using a slightly different method for getting inputs on every project but the effect is 100 % identical).\n\n> It doesn't happen all the time, I would say every 2nd or 3rd time I run my project.\n\nOn my end it happens almost always, I got so used to it that I just developed a habit of smashing some random buttons to make it work before continuing.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954217887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151375503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107267#issuecomment-3151375503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107267","id":3151375503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc671iyP","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T16:05:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T16:09:58Z","body":"Please create MRP\n\n> ### Steps to reproduce\n> Use the default CharacterBody2D example and run the project. Press and release the keyboard button assigned to movement up as soon as the project starts. After half a second, the character will move up until you press and release the key again.\n> \n> ### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n> Very simple project, just create a CharacterBody2D with the example script.\n\n-------------------\n\nTemplate tested on MacOS, it was not reproducible. (4.5 beta3)\n\n\n<img width=\"681\" height=\"436\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/390d883c-164d-4460-b91b-e94d04e476b8\" />\n\n------------------\n\n\nThere is no \"movement up\" there, only Jump\n\n```gdscript\nextends CharacterBody2D\n\n\nconst SPEED = 300.0\nconst JUMP_VELOCITY = -400.0\n\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\t# Add the gravity.\n\tif not is_on_floor():\n\t\tvelocity += get_gravity() * delta\n\n\t# Handle jump.\n\tif Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_accept\") and is_on_floor():\n\t\tvelocity.y = JUMP_VELOCITY\n\n\t# Get the input direction and handle the movement/deceleration.\n\t# As good practice, you should replace UI actions with custom gameplay actions.\n\tvar direction := Input.get_axis(\"ui_left\", \"ui_right\")\n\tif direction:\n\t\tvelocity.x = direction * SPEED\n\telse:\n\t\tvelocity.x = move_toward(velocity.x, 0, SPEED)\n\n\tmove_and_slide()\n\n\n```\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151375503/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3219618223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107267#issuecomment-3219618223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107267","id":3219618223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_53mv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c